The following issues require manual code changes:
  ./ecosystem_grpcreflect_stream.go:11:34: grpcreflect.WithRequestHeaders is removed in v2. Set headers on the context passed to NewStream with connect.NewClientContext(ctx) and info.RequestHeader().
  ./ecosystem_grpcreflect_stream.go:15:6: grpcreflect ClientStream.ResponseHeader is removed in v2. Read call metadata from the connect.NewClientContext(ctx) info passed to NewStream.
  ./ecosystem_grpcreflect_stream.go:22:2: grpcreflect ClientStream.Close returns only an error in v2. Read response headers from the connect.NewClientContext(ctx) info passed to NewStream.

Scanned 1 Go file and 0 Buf templates. 1 rewrite(s) ready (rerun with -w to apply).

